From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:56:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/30] gpu_display: iceland gvm: window input modes (touch /
 tablet / touchpad), multi-finger touch, fullscreen output

- display_wl.c: raw pointer (move / every button / axis) and wl_touch fingers, coordinates scaled from surface
  to buffer pixels (the guest devices' space; before, logical coordinates went to a device sized in buffer px);
  wl_output v4 names; CROSVM_GVM_FULLSCREEN=1 + CROSVM_GVM_OUTPUT=<name|index> open the window fullscreen
- gvm_input.rs: the mode mapper (CROSVM_GVM_INPUT_MODE), unit-tested: tablet (tap = click where it lands,
  drag, long press = right click, two-finger scroll / tap), touchpad (relative pointer, tap, long press,
  two-finger scroll / tap), touch (multi-touch slots, the upstream left-button touch)
- devices: a virtio tablet (ABS_X/Y, buttons, wheel + hwheel); in tablet / touchpad mode the window and the
  simplefb window get a tablet and a mouse next to the touch screen (EventDeviceKind::Tablet)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
